01:27:46.333 --> 01:27:47.458
Ivy Damalet.

01:27:48.250 --> 01:27:49.083
Kenal?

01:27:50.041 --> 01:27:51.250
Nama akhir tukang kebun.

01:27:53.541 --> 01:27:54.625
