-Diam!

01:29:21.250 --> 01:29:23.041
Namun, ayahku mendorongnya.

01:29:23.125 --> 01:29:24.958
-Ayah, hentikan!
-Sudah, diam!

01:29:30.041 --> 01:29:32.666
Lalu kakakmu di sana, merekam semuanya.

01:29:33.583 --> 01:29:35.750
Jangan sampai dia pergi. Kejar!

01:29:36.625 --> 01:29:37.500
Henry!

01:29:39.000 --> 01:29:40.625
Dia kuikuti ke tangga.

01:29:41.500 --> 01:29:42.708
Henry!

01:29:42.791 --> 01:29:43.750
Henry, tunggu!

01:29:43.833 --> 01:29:45.166
Sampai kami tiba di atap.

01:29:52.833 --> 01:29:53.958
Tenanglah.

01:29:54.041 --> 01:29:55.291
Kau dorong dia.

01:29:55.375 --> 01:29:57.458
-Dia jatuh. Itu kecelakaan.
-Kau dorong.

01:29:58.125 --> 01:29:59.583
Aku cuma mau bicara.

01:29:59.666 --> 01:30:01.416
Lepaskan atau kutelepon polisi.

01:30:01.500 --> 01:30:03.916
-Kau dorong dia.
-Tidak, aku berusaha bicara.

01:30:04.000 --> 01:30:06.958
-Menenangkannya, tapi saat mendekat…
-Kau bunuh dia.

01:30:07.041 --> 01:30:08.333
Turunlah, ayo bicara.

01:30:08.416 --> 01:30:10.500
-Kau tak akan melepaskanku.
-Henry!

01:30:13.166 --> 01:30:14.208
Kau bunuh dia.

