01:35:50.041 --> 01:35:51.500
Adrik, tidak!

01:35:52.250 --> 01:35:53.500
-Adrik!
-Aegan!

01:35:54.208 --> 01:35:55.291
Adrik!

01:36:53.125 --> 01:36:54.541
